                "text": "King County's Department of Community and Human Service is losing $1.4 million in funding for substance abuse treatment and mental health services at the hands of the Trump administration. Eight programs will be hit by these cuts, including crisis hotlines and substance abuse counseling for teenagers. This costs jobs and puts thousands of lives at risk. The President is putting tax cuts for billionaires over the wellbeing of our neighbors in Washington. https://t.co/P29pWc8P3N",
