                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In May, we recognize Mental Health Awareness Month, a time for us to have real conversations about our mental health to reduce the stigma around these diagnoses.\n\nHaving publicly spoken about my anxiety, I can personally attest that exploring treatment options helped me find strategies to manage my mental health.\n\nMore than one in five adults have a mental health condition, yet care remains unaffordable and inaccessible. We need more pathways to treatment and support year-round. Recovery is possible and our nation needs to help out all that are fighting.",
