                "text": "After seeing the impact on FDC SeaTac, I signed onto a letter urging restoration of collective bargaining rights at the Bureau of Prisons. The BOP's decision to cancel their collective bargaining agreement jeopardized worker safety, fair treatment, accountability, and staff morale, while harming both employees and the prison system at large. To honor federal workers' rights, it is essential that safe and fair labor practices are upheld for correctional departments across our country.",
